# Commits

- Local commits only. Do not `git push` unless the operator explicitly asks.
- Stage-scoped commit messages (e.g. `stage0: scaffold package, rules, skills`).
- Commit after each stage exit (green tests + stage note).
- Never force-push; never amend unless explicitly requested and conditions allow.
